journal            560 internal/journal
# ADR-123: budget 400 -> 520 (guard harian/bulanan/provider + formula token gambar; terukur 481).
# ADR-125: budget 520 -> 560 (jadwal harga bertanggal GAP-COST-01; terukur 530).
